dialect protocol
protocol shooting.spr
version 1
schema shooting.shooting.mutation
start record
framing record
record shooting.shooting-add-layer tag 1
field format u8
field ordinal varint
field body bytes
record shooting.shooting-set-stroke tag 2
field format u8
field ordinal varint
field body bytes
record shooting.shooting-move-layer tag 3
field format u8
field ordinal varint
field body bytes
chain hash u64
